{"sequence":55,"timestamp":"2026-03-30T09:07:00.729601460Z","event_type":"amendment_queued","details":{"amendment_id":"fr-4-08002dd1","body":"`crates/tank_harness/tests/e2e_habitat_geometry_probes.rs:153-166` still documents `probe_biofilter_scaling_bigger_media_faster_cycling` as proving that 2× media yields a larger nitrifier population/faster cycling, but `:246-263` now only checks that both runs clear a fixed `0.02 g` floor. On the current branch the large-filter run finishes with less nitrifier biomass than the small filter and still passes, so this probe no longer guards the behavior it is named and documented to validate.","dedup_key":"c3541d3ea5065cc796328190abc5a694cd01db653137eeeccd6093b6135e1e6f","run_id":"run-20260330064830","source":"workflow_stage","source_stage":"final_review"}}
{"sequence":56,"timestamp":"2026-03-30T09:07:00.738385009Z","event_type":"amendment_queued","details":{"amendment_id":"fr-4-e772c7bf","body":"`crates/tank_harness/tests/e2e_habitat_geometry_probes.rs:627-631` says the redox probe should verify that denitrifier activity matures over time, but `:658-659` now seeds `denitrifier_activity_index = 1.0` and `:847-853` only asserts that the final value stays above `0.5`. That no longer exercises the ramp/decay logic in `crates/tank_core/src/systems/nitrogen_cycle.rs:973-989`; a bug that prevents maturation or breaks the suboxic-zone coupling would still pass.","dedup_key":"ca033170dbf344eaa5ab70720e34bf7198b0aaaa0a8485e9299d55843b8d6f43","run_id":"run-20260330064830","source":"workflow_stage","source_stage":"final_review"}}
{"sequence":57,"timestamp":"2026-03-30T09:07:00.747058310Z","event_type":"amendment_queued","details":{"amendment_id":"fr-4-d4d1e581","body":"`crates/tank_harness/tests/e2e_habitat_geometry_probes.rs:660-662` gives the “planted” arm `10.0 g` decomposer biomass while `:740-741` gives the inert control only `2.0 g`, and `:711-713` zeroes all plant biomass. Because substrate O2 demand is driven directly by decomposer biomass in `crates/tank_core/src/systems/substrate.rs:221-236`, the comparison is now confounded: the test can pass from the artificially higher decomposer-driven suboxia even if the planted-substrate mechanism regresses, and it no longer actually exercises a live-planted setup despite the test name/docs.","dedup_key":"529ee7611cd7ebc565e818a98e7b92c20f4baeafb983fa72019dd04f2f16e79a","run_id":"run-20260330064830","source":"workflow_stage","source_stage":"final_review"}}
